    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your INVENTORIX device\u00a0(crafted by space gnomes) to extract maximum value from interstellar items and recruit aliens to boost your earnings. Pay off a mysterious debt or push your luck to create astronomical wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.poster.avif?t=1753926506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.webm?t=1753926506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.mp4?t=1753926506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic profits</strong>: Earn cosmic cash, ka-ching, ka-ching, ka-ching!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Pack items and aliens to uncover powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95+ Items</strong>: Pick them wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Alien Perks</strong>: Which ones best support your build?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>15+ Item Classes</strong>: Go all-in on a single class or mix them up for cosmic synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Roguelike:</strong> Fast, replayable runs packed with variety.<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>10 INVENTORIX Devices</strong>: Unlock them and explore unique strategies with each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20 Difficulty Levels</strong>: Conquer escalating challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounter</strong>: Dubious Space Loan Sharks to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can your build go?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Codex: </strong>Complete your Codex by identifying new items and aliens.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your INVENTORIX device\u00a0(crafted by space gnomes) to extract maximum value from interstellar items and recruit aliens to boost your earnings. Pay off a mysterious debt or push your luck to create astronomical wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.poster.avif?t=1753926506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.webm?t=1753926506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.mp4?t=1753926506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic profits</strong>: Earn cosmic cash, ka-ching, ka-ching, ka-ching!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Pack items and aliens to uncover powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95+ Items</strong>: Pick them wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Alien Perks</strong>: Which ones best support your build?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>15+ Item Classes</strong>: Go all-in on a single class or mix them up for cosmic synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Roguelike:</strong> Fast, replayable runs packed with variety.<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>10 INVENTORIX Devices</strong>: Unlock them and explore unique strategies with each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20 Difficulty Levels</strong>: Conquer escalating challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounter</strong>: Dubious Space Loan Sharks to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can your build go?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Codex: </strong>Complete your Codex by identifying new items and aliens.</p></li></ul>",
